<title>AUSTRIA: Wienerberger sees 97 pretax over 2 bln ATS.</title>
<headline>Wienerberger sees 97 pretax over 2 bln ATS.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wienerberger Baustoffindustrie, the world's largest brickmaker, said on Wednesday it expected to post a higher pretax profit in 1997 of over two billion schillings after 1.37 billion last year.</p>
<p>Wienerberger reiterated in a statement that first quarter pretax profit reached 36 million schillings after a loss of 30 million in the year-ago period.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12256</p>
